  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PBZ Leasing Croatia - MSME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior loan of up to &#x20ac;25 million to PBZ-Leasing Croatia (&quot;PBZL&quot;)  for on-lending to local micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (&quot;MSMEs&quot;)  under the Financial Intermediaries Framework (&quot;FIF&quot;).  The loan will be used to provide leases to micro, small and medium-sized  enterprises (&quot;MSMEs&quot;) in Croatia. It will also support the Bank&apos;s Green Economy  Transition (&quot;GET&quot;) approach by dedicating at least 30 per cent of the facility  to the financing of GET eligible sub-projects in Croatia based on the Green  Technology Selector of eligible assets for Croatia.</narrative>
  </description>
